      <details>
        <summary>Is the app in English?</summary>
        <div class="ans">The interface is in Italian: menus, buttons and messages. Prompts can be
        written in English, and the menus that build them write English terms for you.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which graphics card do I need?</summary>
        <div class="ans">For local images, an NVIDIA GPU with <b>10 GB</b> or more and about 12 GB of
        disk. Full-size video needs <b>16 GB</b> or more and about 17 GB of disk. For the cloud
        alone, any Windows PC with an internet connection and an API key will do.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is local generation really free?</summary>
        <div class="ans">Yes. It runs on your GPU, goes through no server and has no per-image cost:
